msgid "WebGIS related tools"
msgstr "WebGIS相关工具"

msgid ""
"This part introduces tools related to WebGIS, including OWSLib, mappyfile, "
"etc."
msgstr "这部分介绍了与WebGIS相关的工具，包括OWSLib、映射文件等。"

msgid "Introduction and installation of OWSlib"
msgstr "OWSlib简介及安装"

msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "引言"

msgid ""
"OWSLib is a Python package for client-side programming with the Open "
"Geospatial Consortium (OGC) Web Services (OWS) interface standard and its "
"associated content model."
msgstr "OWSLib是一个使用开放地理空间联盟(OGC)Web服务(OWS)接口标准及其相关内容模型进行客户端编程的Python包。"

msgid ""
"OWSLib was originally included in PCL, but was proposed as a separate "
"project in R481."
msgstr "OWSLib最初包括在PCL中，但在R481中作为一个单独的项目提出。"

msgid ""
"OGC Web services toollibrary, Python package uses OGC maps, functions, and "
"overlay services. OWSLib provides general API access GetCapabilities, "
"service metadata and wrapper access maps, and GETFEATURE requests."
msgstr ""
"OGC "
"Web服务工具库，Python包使用OGC地图、函数和覆盖服务。OWSLib提供通用的API访问GetCapability、服务元数据和包装器访问映射以及GETFEATURE请求。"

msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"
